e>painted</code> with the area it changed.</p>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#functions_1","level":3,"title":"Functions","text":"","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#constructorcanvas-func","level":4,"title":"<code>[constructor]canvas: func</code>","text":"<p>Creates a white canvas of <code>width</code> by <code>height</code> pixels (at least 1 by 1).</p>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#params_1","level":5,"title":"Params","text":"<ul> <li><code>width</code>: <code>s32</code></li> <li><code>height</code>: <code>s32</code></li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#return-values","level":5,"title":"Return values","text":"<ul> <li> own&lt;<code>canvas</code>&gt;</li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#methodcanvasid-func","level":4,"title":"<code>[method]canvas.id: func</code>","text":"<p>Instance id; signals from this instance carry it as <code>source</code>.</p>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#params_2","level":5,"title":"Params","text":"<ul> <li><code>self</code>: borrow&lt;<code>canvas</code>&gt;</li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#return-values_1","level":5,"title":"Return values","text":"<ul> <li> <code>u32</code></li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#methodcanvassize-func","level":4,"title":"<code>[method]canvas.size: func</code>","text":"<p>This property holds the canvas size in pixels, fixed when it is created.</p> <p>Q_PROPERTY read: Canvas::size</p>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#params_3","level":5,"title":"Params","text":"<ul> <li><code>self</code>: borrow&lt;<code>canvas</code>&gt;</li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#return-values_2","level":5,"title":"Return values","text":"<ul> <li> <code>size</code