de>: <code>text-options</code></li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#return-values_3","level":5,"title":"Return values","text":"<ul> <li> <code>rect</code></li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#methodcanvasfont-families-func","level":4,"title":"<code>[method]canvas.font-families: func</code>","text":"<p>Returns the font families the component can draw with.</p>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#params_7","level":5,"title":"Params","text":"<ul> <li><code>self</code>: borrow&lt;<code>canvas</code>&gt;</li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#return-values_4","level":5,"title":"Return values","text":"<ul> <li> list&lt;<code>string</code>&gt;</li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#methodcanvaspixel-func","level":4,"title":"<code>[method]canvas.pixel: func</code>","text":"<p>Returns the colour of the pixel at <code>at</code>, or nothing when <code>at</code> is outside the canvas.</p>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#params_8","level":5,"title":"Params","text":"<ul> <li><code>self</code>: borrow&lt;<code>canvas</code>&gt;</li> <li><code>at</code>: <code>point</code></li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#return-values_5","level":5,"title":"Return values","text":"<ul> <li> option&lt;<code>rgba</code>&gt;</li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#methodcanvasimage-func","level":4,"title":"<code>[method]canvas.image: func</code>","text":"<p>Returns the pixels drawn so far, as RGBA.</p>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#params_9","level":5,"title":"Params","text":"<ul> <li><code>self</code>: borrow&lt;<code>canvas</code>&gt;</li> </ul>","path":["demo:canvas@0.1.0"],"tags":[]},{"location":"canvas.html#return-values_6","level":5,"title":"Return values","text":"<